WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.319
In this fictional brief, practice is limited to invented approved intake requests.

00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:08.421
Draft summaries are reviewed before practice use.

00:00:08.421 --> 00:00:12.854
Real customer records, external sending and wider rollout are excluded.

00:00:12.854 --> 00:00:15.956
The service manager authorizes the limited practice.

00:00:15.956 --> 00:00:19.502
The coordinator monitors the log and participant questions.

00:00:19.502 --> 00:00:26.594
The service reviewer checks and corrects drafts and can stop the practice under the supplied rule.

00:00:26.594 --> 00:00:30.140
The policy owner handles permission and information concerns.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.913
Keep those duties distinct.

00:00:31.913 --> 00:00:36.345
A person writing the plan cannot invent their own authority.

00:00:36.345 --> 00:00:42.550
For your continuing project, name the real roles and retain the actual approval reference.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:47.426
If approval is unresolved, keep the experiment simulated with fictional information.

00:00:47.426 --> 00:00:54.961
A bounded plan tells people what they may do and where a human decision is still required.
